  "sideNote": "the logo (templates/ja_smallbiz/images/logo.png: a dark wordmark) is drawn for a light header: under a dark system it is turned light, hues kept; 14/10/2026: the round “Logan” photo with white corners the visual review saw is not on the released quickstart: its home shows a rectangular dark barber photo (features/item-1.jpg, corners #131313) beside “Logan is an amazing Barbershop”; the sweep’s stand served another template’s pictures (a concert hero, a party photo in a baked circle), as found for JA Justitia, Morgan, Rights and Prodex. Nothing to do; 15/10/2026: on a phone (max-width 767px) the slide box (.slider-content-inner, inside the worn .has-bg band) is the template's background: linear-gradient(transparent, #000000) shorthand; the band paints the box's background-color with its accent fill, which showed under that gradient as a box fading from the fill to black, its words (set for the fill) dark on the black end: VIEW MORE read 3.21-4.49:1 on the grey middle (Notion, Airbnb, Eddie, Voiceflow, ElevenLabs, Pitch, Apple at 390, v9 measure: 7 of 34 home views). The box drops the gradient (background-image none, both sides): on a phone it is the band's solid fill under the photo as on a desktop, its words the ones set for that fill. A desktop box has no picture, so nothing changes there; 19/10/2026 (probe v10): the services line icons (img-icon, one-colour PNGs; the photographs the home variants put in the same box are left alone) are drawn black on the light side and white on the dark side; required stars the danger words; the theme pages' slideshow title shadow the accent; the hilite module's dashed separators a mix of its words and fill; neutral buttons ink (light) or an outline in the second text colour (dark); btn-border keeps its words on hover and reads on-ink (accent-on on accent features); mod-dark module titles are accent chips; login fields bg/fg/fg-2 rim, contact fields transparent with a 45% word line; words on status fills black or white by the fill's lightness (oklch); h5/h6, code, the acm intros and the contact misc block read the system faces; secondary buttons, nav pills and the active list item wear the button corner; the All Categories heading and description stay on their own line (a zero-height flex break), as the template lays them out; the active tab of a tab bar rounds its top corners with the button corner",
